        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Leo &mdash; 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p><em>The Saint sends cosmo into the ground, and it erupts as pillars of electricity.</em></p><p>Choose up to <strong>three</strong> 5-foot squares within 60 feet; a pillar of lightning erupts from each.</p><p>A creature in or adjacent to a pillar takes @Damage[3d8[electricity]] damage with a basic Reflex save. A creature caught by two or more pillars rolls once and takes damage once, but suffers a <strong>&minus;2</strong> circumstance penalty to that save. A creature that critically fails is knocked prone.</p><p>The pillars persist for 1 round, shedding bright light and blocking line of sight through their squares.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8. At 10th, 14th, and 18th level, add one pillar.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
